# routeTree.gen.ts is COMMITTED on purpose: the generator only runs inside the
# Vite plugin, so `tsc --noEmit` in CI has no way to produce it. Without the
# committed tree, createFileRoute() ids resolve to `undefined` and typecheck
# fails on a clean clone. The plugin regenerates it on dev/build; a stale tree
# fails typecheck, which is the safe direction.
